{
  "$schema_note": "Declarative table of agents AutoCode can install into. One object per agent; adding an agent is adding an entry. Paths use {home}, {appdata}, {xdg_config}; a 'paths' override per platform (win32/darwin/linux) wins over the default. 'verified': true means a maintainer confirmed these conventions against the agent's docs or a live install; false means best-effort from public docs — doctor says so and the user should confirm.",
  "version": 1,
